.TH geectl-pull-request-merge 1  "geectl-pull-request-merge 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-pull\-request\-merge \- Merge a pull request. On OBS this accepts the submit request and forwards it to its link parent; a refused forward is reported and the accepted request stands. On Gitea the forward is resolved and validated before the merge lands, and the merged pull request is forwarded to its link parent too, unless `\-\-no\-forward` is given. The forwarded request\*(Aqs `.changes` entry is the original description on the OBS arm and the pull request\*(Aqs text on the Gitea arm, overridable with `\-m` / `\-\-forward\-message`. Dry\-run by default; mutates only with `\-\-live`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl pull\-request merge\fR [\fB\-\-message\fR] [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-forward\-message\fR] [\fB\-\-method\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-forward\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREFERENCE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Merge a pull request. On OBS this accepts the submit request and forwards it to its link parent; a refused forward is reported and the accepted request stands. On Gitea the forward is resolved and validated before the merge lands, and the merged pull request is forwarded to its link parent too, unless `\-\-no\-forward` is given. The forwarded request\*(Aqs `.changes` entry is the original description on the OBS arm and the pull request\*(Aqs text on the Gitea arm, overridable with `\-m` / `\-\-forward\-message`. Dry\-run by default; mutates only with `\-\-live`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-message\fR \fI<MESSAGE>\fR
The message left with the merge. Values starting with `\-` are taken literally: a message may open with a `\- ` bullet
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-forward\-message\fR \fI<FORWARD_MESSAGE>\fR
The changes entry for the forwarded request, overriding the original description on the OBS arm and the pull request\*(Aqs text on the Gitea arm. Values starting with `\-` are taken literally: an entry may open with a `\- ` bullet
.TP
\fB\-\-method\fR \fI<METHOD>\fR
The Gitea merge style (Gitea only; refused on an OBS ref)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
merge
.IP \(bu 2
rebase
.IP \(bu 2
rebase\-merge
.IP \(bu 2
squash
.IP \(bu 2
fast\-forward\-only
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Accept past open reviews (OBS only; refused on a Gitea ref)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-forward\fR
Do not forward the pull request after merging it: by default a merged Gitea pull request is forwarded to its link parent. (Gitea only; refused on an OBS ref.)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
The pull\-request handle: `obs:<id>` or `gitea:<owner>/<repo>#<number>`
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
